ifier ran on 5 listed files; no full-repo build claim","pause":null,"plan":{"schema":"co.task-plan/2","steps":[{"focus":"architecture_planning","id":"s1","inputs":[],"instructions":"Design step for section D (EXE02-file/1) of docs/design/contracts-v5/PARALLEL-SCOPE-2.md. Follow it exactly and keep the settled API unchanged. Assess the bounded file-only API (decode_file, frozen DecodedFile, FilePayloadError) before implementation. Output a concise design covering: (1) the exact validation order: max_bytes, payload type, raw bound, strict UTF-8 decode before JSON, duplicate keys, nonfinite constants, object and required fields, rejected fields, size limit, CR/LF-only strip, canonical standard Base64 including pad bits, decoded bound, size equality, strict UTF-8 text; (2) the error code for each failure; (3) the fixed message strings; (4) how errors are raised with no __cause__/__context__ and no input echo; (5) frozen dataclass details; (6) a synthetic test case list covering every case listed in scope. No I/O, IDs, common types, Ref/Result or INT00 duplication. Flag concrete contradictions instead of inventing wire.","role":"design"},{"focus":"coding","id":"s2","inputs":["s1"],"instructions":"Implement section D of docs/design/contracts-v5/PARALLEL-SCOPE-2.md exactly. Use the s1 design where it agrees with scope; scope wins on any conflict. Write only pal/github_file_payload_v5.py and tests/test_github_file_payload_v5.py. Stdlib only. No API changes, I/O, network, DB, IDs, common types or INT00 duplication. Use exact type checks (reject bool and subclasses). Errors: FilePayloadError with code invalid_input|limit and a fixed bounded message, raised outside except blocks so no caught exception is retained. Tests use synthetic fixtures only and cover every section D case. They must pass: python3.13 -E -s -B -m unittest discover -s tests -p test_github_file_payload_v5.py -v. Return both complete files and any concrete remaining problems.","role":"implement"},{"focus":"re